    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Adverbs of frequency",
     "texto": [
      "Adverbs such as **zawsze** («always»), **często** («often»), **czasem** («sometimes») and **nigdy** («never») usually go near the verb.",
      "To make a negative, **nie** goes before the verb: **nigdy nie pracuję** («I never work»). Here the negative does not always require changing the object to the genitive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
